  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be defined,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>So, domain is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>"
